# Verity

## Unit Tests

yarn vka verity:test.jest                      # Run unit tests for verity package
yarn vka verity:test.jest -- --coverageReporters=lcov    # Run unit tests for verity package and generate lcov coverage report

## Screenshot Tests

# Run these to regenerate screenshots
yarn storycap:verity:capture:local
yarn storycap:verity:compare
yarn storycap:verity:update

yarn storycap:verity:report


# For legacy, do the same but with "legacy"
yarn storycap:legacy:capture:local 

